{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20906","headline":"屏风曲 · 李贺","name":"屏风曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝶栖石竹银交关，水凝绿鸭瑠璃钱。\n团回六曲抱膏兰，将鬟镜上掷金蝉。\n沈香火暖茱萸烟，酒觥绾带新承懽。\n月风吹露屏外寒，城上乌啼楚女眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}